  "body": "### Describe the bug\n\nWhen trying to open the \"Tasks\" page it throws an error. \n\nApplication error: a server-side exception has occurred while loading _websitename_.com (see the server logs for more information).\nDigest: 3372858902\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nClick on Management, go to Tools, then Tasks\n\n### Impact\n\nMinimal but cannot configure any tasks\n\n### Additional information\n\nHomarr was built from source on an LXC in Proxmox (similar to the Proxmox Helper script)\n\nLogs show the following -\n\nSep 27 02:54:17 Homarr pnpm[19207]: [2]  <E2><A8><AF> Error [TRPCError]: fetch failed\nSep 27 02:54:17 Homarr pnpm[19207]: [2]     at a.from (.next/server/chunks/2744.js:82:52699)\nSep 27 02:54:17 Homarr pnpm[19207]: [2]     at <unknown> (.next/server/chunks/2744.js:82:56119) {\nSep 27 02:54:17 Homarr pnpm[19207]: [2]   code: 'INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR',\nSep 27 02:54:17 Homarr pnpm[19207]: [2]   digest: '3372858902',\nSep 27 02:54:17 Homarr pnpm[19207]: [2]   [cause]: Error [TRPCClientError]: fetch failed\nSep 27 02:54:17 Homarr pnpm[19207]: [2]       at a.from (.next/server/chunks/2744.js:82:52699)\nSep 27 02:54:17 Homarr pnpm[19207]: [2]       at <unknown> (.next/server/chunks/2744.js:82:56119) {\nSep 27 02:54:17 Homarr pnpm[19207]: [2]     shape: undefined,\nSep 27 02:54:17 Homarr pnpm[19207]: [2]     data: undefined,\nSep 27 02:54:17 Homarr pnpm[19207]: [2]     meta: undefined,\nSep 27 02:54:17 Homarr pnpm[19207]: [2]     [cause]: TypeError: fetch failed\nSep 27 02:54:17 Homarr pnpm[19207]: [2]         at async D (.next/server/chunks/2744.js:82:54545) {\nSep 27 02:54:17 Homarr pnpm[19207]: [2]       [cause]: [AggregateError: ] { code: 'ECONNREFUSED' }\nSep 27 02:54:17 Homarr pnpm[19207]: [2]     }\nSep 27 02:54:17 Homarr pnpm[19207]: [2]   }\nSep 27 02:54:17 Homarr pnpm[19207]: [2] }\n\n\n### Version\n\n1.39.0\n\n### Installation method\n\nFrom Source\n\n### Browser\n\nFirefox",
